Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,﻿1
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna let me in, right?\N- No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got business to run here. Back of the...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.35,0:01:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yo, Maurice.\N- Jack. Jackie Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackie Jack. Jackie Jack.\NJack, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.81,0:01:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And Miss Lovely Amber Waves. Mwah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Maurice.\N- Como estas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.57,0:01:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've been pissed you haven't been around.\N- Uh, we were on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever stay away\Nfrom my club that long again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- You got it.\N- And not for nothing, honey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.58,0:02:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...but you are the sexiest bitch\Nin the entire county. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.87,0:02:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a charmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen.\NI got your booth set up over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Some clams, I'm gonna send right over.\NListen, Jack. I'm ready, I'm available.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.55,0:02:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You put me in a movie, okay?\NWe're talking box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, yeah, yeah.\N- Box office, Jack. Chi-Chi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi-chi, listen. Jack and Amber's table.\NTake them over an order of clams. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.72,0:02:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how's it going here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, baby. Me and you,\Nwe'll take a picture later on, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? Hey, hey, hey. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we were looking for you before, man.\NWhere were you, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.12,0:02:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. Okay, I was here.\N- Seriously, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- I love you.\N- I love you, Beck. I love you, Beck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Maurice. Hey, cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cow...? That's a cowboy?\N- Cowboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.09,0:02:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...\NThere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- You like it? It's nice, right?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- If you like it, it's okay.\N- I love it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.01,0:03:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Cool. Real cool.\N- Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.43,0:03:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Compliments of Maurice.\N- Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I get a margarita, please?\N- Uh, 7-Up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Rollergirl.\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you call that girl today?\N- I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't do it tomorrow, it'll be the\Nweekend, you'll never be able to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.45,0:03:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- I gotta go pee.\N- Well, go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.05,0:03:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.68,0:03:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, let's get the album.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.18,0:04:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Jack.\N- Little Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.05,0:04:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi.\N- Hi, Amber. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, how's our schedule?\NAre we still on for day after tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.35,0:04:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,More like the day after\Nthe day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack, come on. I gotta call Rocky, Scotty,\NKurt. I gotta call those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.19,0:04:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna keep a small group on this one.\NA small crew. Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.69,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- A low-key deal?\N- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, do...? I'm sorry.\NDo we...? Do we have a script?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- So how you doing?\N- Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- How old are you?\N- I have a work permit. I have all the papers...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing like that.\NYou been working here long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.03,0:05:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,A month.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Maurice give you the job?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You from around here?\NI mean, uh, Canoga? Reseda?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- Um, no. You know where Torrance is?\N- Yeah. How do you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.92,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, what do you wanna be?\N- Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean, you take the bus from Torrance\Nto come here to Reseda to do this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you get a job like this in Torrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.23,0:05:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, but I don't want to.\N- Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:05:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...you want 5 or 10?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.87,0:06:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you just wanna see me jack off,\Nit's 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you just wanna look at it,\Nit's only 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Guys pay you to watch you, do they?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- You already done it tonight?\N- Couple times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- And you can do it again?\N- If you want. If you got 10 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.30,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Eddie. Eddie Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.10,0:06:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eddie Adams from Torrance.\N- Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Jack Horner, filmmaker.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I make, uh, adult films,\Nexotic pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I know who you are.\NI read about you in a magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside Amber, Amanda's Ride.\NYou made those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right.\N- Those are great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.82,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...I'm not full of doggy doo-doo.\N- Heh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna come back to the table\Nand, uh, you know, have a drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'd love to, but I gotta work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to work, get money,\Nyou know, pay the rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yea... I mean, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I need money, but I don't pay rent.\NI still live at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.84,0:07:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How old are you, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Seventeen-year-old piece of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Heh, yeah, right.\N- Why don't you come to the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got some people I'd like you to meet.\N- I do know you. I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.56,0:07:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to come to your table for a drink.\NObviously, you're not full of, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.19,0:07:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- Doggy doo-doo.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.78,0:07:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just couldn't walk out on Maurice.\NI'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.99,0:07:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.95,0:07:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling, beneath those jeans there's\Nsomething wonderful just waiting to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.22,0:07:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, guys.\N- Bill. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not a lot. What are you guys up to?\N- Don't know, probably just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll see you guys later.\N- What are you still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I sleep at your place?\N- Half-hour, I'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.44,0:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye, Maurice.\N- Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.82,0:08:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Love you, mamita. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the man that you let in anytime,\Nyou understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.28,0:08:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ha, ha.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Luego.\N- Hasta manana.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fix you some eggs, beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.92,0:08:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm going to sleep. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, honey-tits. Sleep beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom? Hi. Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that it's late, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Andy there? Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.97,0:09:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to say hello to my son,\Nand that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.27,0:09:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something you don't know.\NI know a lawyer. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.86,0:09:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You might think I don't, but I do,\Nand I'll take you to court.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:40.100,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom, don't. Come on, Tom.\NPlease. Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.60,0:10:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck does it look like I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.23,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I close the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I close the door?\NThat's my wife, you asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.74,0:11:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out. Go sleep on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.95,0:11:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop, big stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.21,0:13:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Jesus, please, okay?\NShave if you're gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.67,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- You scratch my face.\N- Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.89,0:13:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good morning.\N- Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it at work?\NYou get home late, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- You know, you work in a nightclub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If it means so much to you,\Nyou should find one that's closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.40,0:13:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.99,0:13:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- At a car wash.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You work at a car wash.\NYou work at a nightclub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,School never occurred to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye, Dad.\N- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.10,0:14:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So basically, you're getting\Ntwice the bass with the TK-421...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...which we've, uh, got available\Nin this system right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I don't really\Nknow if I need all that bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think you need all that bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, I mean, if you want a system\Nto handle what you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...yeah, you need the bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,See, this... This is hi-fi, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.83,0:14:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,High fidelity. Know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That means\Nthis is the highest quality fidelity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.63,0:14:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi-fi. Those are two very important things\Nto have in a stereo system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's the price. For the 420...\N- I have this very unit in my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I got it modified\Nwith the TK-421...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...which, uh, kicks it up another...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:15:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...I don't know, maybe three or four, um,\Nquads per channel, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's really... That's technical talk.\NThat doesn't really concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.61,0:15:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Still a little uncertain, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.41,0:15:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what you need?\NYou need a test drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.41,0:15:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you need.\NYou need a test drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.58,0:15:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to hear it from Buck's mouth,\Nit's another to hear it from the TK-421.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me just pop in this 8-track...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.09,0:15:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...and you just give a listen,\Ntell me what you think, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that? You hear the bass? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.05,0:15:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear it? It kicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.85,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns. It curls up your belly.\NMakes you wanna freaky-deaky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.98,0:15:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh, you got that?\NNow, see, if you get this system as is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's not gonna sound like this\Nwithout the TK-421 modification...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we do that in the store right here,\Nvery small price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on and move with it if you need to.\NIt helps me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. Well, hey. So long, partner.
