Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.17,1:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is what he gave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.59,1:06:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you take a little sip\Nand tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.34,1:06:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is supposed to be really good stuff.\NHere. Take a sip.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.97,1:06:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that pretty light?\N- Yeah, that is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.68,1:06:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baby, it's beautiful.\N- What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.97,1:06:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's great?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.22,1:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look how spacious it is.\N- Yeah. Look, I like this too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.89,1:06:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's custom-made.\NThat's real imported ltalian leather.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.73,1:06:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- This color is very unusual.\N- Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.27,1:06:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that?\N- My initials.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.44,1:06:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so imaginative.\NHow'd you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.94,1:06:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking of my name one day\Nand dreamt it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.70,1:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Dirk.\N- How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.91,1:06:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm almost finished.\N- Looks great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.70,1:06:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I used a little poetic license\Nto capture your essence.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.41,1:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Show me the rest of the house?\N- Looks great.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.62,1:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's good for conversation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.66,1:06:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Jessie did that oil painting as well\Nand Buck is still installing the stereo.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.09,1:06:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's a beanbag.\N- You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.88,1:06:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And that lamp, those are real sterling silver.\NYeah, they have a very modern feel too.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.09,1:06:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be the place\Nyou could have conversations.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.72,1:06:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- You ready?\N- What is this? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.43,1:06:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ta-da.\N- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.10,1:07:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is my dojo.\N- It's all Asian. You have an Asian room.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.77,1:07:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. It has that whole karate feel.\N- Nice. It's very comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.11,1:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. A lot of ancient China.\N- That's really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.61,1:07:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I have my statues for my best-actor awards.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.74,1:07:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a place\Nto keep your awards. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.07,1:07:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.95,1:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's handy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.37,1:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you see yourself?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.95,1:07:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's great, huh?\N- That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.62,1:07:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ta-da.\N- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.79,1:07:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- My whole entire wardrobe.\N- That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.91,1:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all perfectly organized by color,\Nas well as designer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.29,1:07:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to think about anything. You\Njust reach in and know right where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.92,1:07:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're gonna love it.\N- Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.38,1:07:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite thing\Nin the whole world. Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.59,1:07:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay, you ready?\N- Yeah, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.93,1:07:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't it beautiful?\N- Oh, God. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.56,1:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. This is the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.73,1:07:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You deserve this, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.36,1:07:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it great? This is the most beautiful\Nthing I've ever seen in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.40,1:07:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wanna go for a ride?\N- Oh, yeah. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.53,1:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this thing. She rocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.74,1:08:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.33,1:08:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah!\N- Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.79,1:08:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on.\N- Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.100,1:08:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- You set us up, Chico.\N- You wanna fuck with Raphael and Ringo...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.25,1:08:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...that's your business.\NYou don't fuck with Chest and Brock.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.21,1:08:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- No...\N- You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.38,1:08:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- You're not even worth it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.05,1:08:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you a chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.47,1:08:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I trusted him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.98,1:08:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we almost solved the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.61,1:08:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,At least the women are safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.19,1:08:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go get some of that\NSaturday-night beaver.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.78,1:08:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No one fucks with Chest and Brock.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.62,1:08:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best work we've ever done.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.04,1:08:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real film, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.21,1:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- It feels good.\N- You made it fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.26,1:08:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this is the film...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.76,1:09:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...I want them to remember me by.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.44,1:09:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.79,1:09:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, as far as I'm concerned,\Nit's all about love, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.30,1:09:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you love someone,\Nhow hard can the world be?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.84,1:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, uh, people will come\Nand they will go, and so will problems...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.43,1:09:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...but ultimately, if you have got love\Non your side, and it is just...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.85,1:09:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nit is just deep down in your soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.27,1:09:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...what's a problem gonna be\Nthat takes your attention away from that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.90,1:10:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.24,1:10:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm Becky Barnett.\N- I'm Jerome.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.33,1:10:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- Nice to meet you.\N- Nice to meet you too, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.100,1:10:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- So, what do you do?\N- Oh, uh, I'm in the auto industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.92,1:10:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.17,1:10:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm a regional manager\Nover at Pep Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.80,1:10:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.09,1:10:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.76,1:10:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a really nice smile, Becky.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.80,1:10:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, heh, heh...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.47,1:10:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...Jerome. Ha, ha.\N- Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.48,1:10:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Colonel.\N- Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.03,1:10:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Floyd Gondolli. Ha, ha. Great you\Ncould make it. Great, great, great.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.95,1:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- How are you? You look happy.\N- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.58,1:10:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Meet boys, Tommy, Pete.\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.92,1:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet girls, Cyndi, Angie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.04,1:10:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi.\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.42,1:10:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- These are the next stars.\N- Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.84,1:11:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- These are the real people in the world.\N- Ah, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.43,1:11:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we ought to talk with Jack now.\NIron this out before we start the new year?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.85,1:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.35,1:11:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking? What\Nwere you feeling? Did you do research?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.85,1:11:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi, Amber.\N- What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.85,1:11:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, nothing.\N- You wanna come with me for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.15,1:11:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Where?\N- It's a surprise, surprise, surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.36,1:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go. Excuse me, Jessie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.06,1:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Buck.\N- Hey, Jessie. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.60,1:11:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- You sitting alone?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.15,1:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Todd Parker.\N- Rocking Reed Rothchild.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.24,1:12:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aw, you made it. Yeah. Woo-hoo.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.83,1:12:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing party, man.\NFucking chicks everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.16,1:12:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet. Courtesy of Jack Horner.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.91,1:12:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind me having\Na piece of that action right over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.17,1:12:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Michelle. I'll introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.05,1:12:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sure. Introduce her to my lap.\N- Ha, ha. Did you get off work, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.97,1:12:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't dance Sunday nights.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.26,1:12:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Whose Vette is that out in the driveway?\N- Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.47,1:12:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm so jealous of him.\N- That shit's jamming.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.77,1:12:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dropped down low with a 350 cube,\N3-and-a-quarter horsepower...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.10,1:12:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...4-speed, 4.10 gears,\N10 coats of competition orange...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.27,1:12:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...hand-rubbed lacquer\Nwith a dual-plane manifold.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.11,1:12:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsk, full fucking race cams. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.40,1:12:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.16,1:12:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty happy with it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.62,1:12:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great look for you, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.50,1:13:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty original, you know, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.67,1:13:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.80,1:13:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. I'm gonna take this off.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.39,1:13:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ha, ha.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.14,1:13:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What were we talking about before?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.14,1:13:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Um, oil painting?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.98,1:13:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- No... Yes. I mean, um, but I was saying...\N- Oh, oh, oh. Sunsets.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, yeah.\NI was saying that I love sunsets.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.90,1:13:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- But sunrises are better. Heh.\N- Exactly. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.32,1:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was the only one\Nwho felt that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.95,1:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I feel that way.\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.99,1:13:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, really. Hey, have you ever heard\Nmy stereo system?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.49,1:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- No.\N- I'm gonna open my own business.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.87,1:13:41.100,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes. Yes. It's my dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.17,1:13:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's hi-fi stereo equipment\Nat discount prices.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.30,1:13:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's called\NBuck's Super Stereo World.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- That is a fucking great idea. Heh.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.39,1:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, in the 80s,\Nthat's when it's gonna happen for real.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:14:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Yes, really. The 1980s.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.52,1:14:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.40,1:14:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to give me a minute\Nso I could tell you how much I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.94,1:14:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's gonna be a new year and\Nwe're gonna start things and do things...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.70,1:14:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I just wanted you to know\Nhow much I care about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.37,1:14:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I really care about you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.99,1:14:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're my little baby.\N- Thank you, Amber.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.04,1:14:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best thing that's happened to me\Nsince my son went off, and I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.88,1:14:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.54,1:14:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.26,1:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking 1980, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.01,1:14:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can you believe it?\N- I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.64,1:14:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's like, the next thing you know\Nit's gonna be, like, 1990 and 2000.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.60,1:14:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- I mean, can you imagine?\N- Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.89,1:14:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, 1979. Hello, 1980.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.73,1:14:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.23,1:14:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you snort it back real quick\Nand hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.74,1:14:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Huh?\N- Like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.46,1:15:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.09,1:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ugh, it burns.\N- It's good though, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.47,1:15:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's going in my throat.\N- Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the drip. The drip's the best part.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.14,1:15:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- It tastes like aspirin.\N- Here. Do one more in the other nostril.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.60,1:15:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- I need a drink of water, I think.\N- Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.35,1:15:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,One more, and then a drink of water.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.74,1:15:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I look cool when I do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.16,1:15:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's talk about the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.45,1:15:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about what video means\Nto this industry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.50,1:15:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's talk about how all of us...\NNot one of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.17,1:15:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How all of us are gonna profit.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.92,1:15:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been doing theater in San Francisco\Nand San Diego...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.72,1:15:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...about as long as\Nyou've been doing stag and hard-core.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.22,1:15:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all familiar with your biography,\NFloyd.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.72,1:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is doubting your credentials\Nor your history.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.43,1:16:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why the resistance?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.48,1:16:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this industry is gonna\Nbe turned upside down soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.98,1:16:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why help it?\N- Why not be prepared?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.98,1:16:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Colonel's got the money.\NYou got the talent, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.69,1:16:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the connection to the equipment\Nand the mail-order distribution.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.78,1:16:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention those kids out there\Nwho are hot fuck action to the max, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.33,1:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the future.\NVideotape tells the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.91,1:16:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. You come into my house,\Nmy party, to tell me about the future?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.01,1:16:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That the future is tape, videotape,\Nand not film?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.76,1:16:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's amateurs and not professionals?\NI'm a filmmaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.35,1:16:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I will never make a movie\Non videotape.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.68,1:16:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.52,1:16:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never, ever loan out\Nany of the actors...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.65,1:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...that I have under contract to you.\N- Wait, wait, wait, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.02,1:16:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a complicated man. I like cinema.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.28,1:16:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In particular,\NI like to see people fucking on film.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.20,1:17:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna win an Oscar,\Nand I don't wanna reinvent the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.37,1:17:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I like simple pleasures like butter\Nin my ass, lollipops in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.54,1:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just me.\NThat's just something that I enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.04,1:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me crazy, call me a pervert...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.88,1:17:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...but there's one little thing\Nthat I wanna do in this life...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.13,1:17:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that is I wanna make\Na dollar and a cent in this business.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.97,1:17:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, Jack, I'm not trying to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.59,1:17:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to help you\Nstay one step ahead of the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.01,1:17:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going in circles now.\NWe're in familiar territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.85,1:17:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The territory we're in is the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.15,1:17:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.36,1:17:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if it looks like shit\Nand it sounds like shit...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.73,1:17:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...then it must be shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.99,1:17:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You're holding on too tight, Jack.\NIt doesn't have to look good.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.24,1:17:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Film is just too damn expensive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.70,1:17:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And the theaters are already converting\Nto video projectors.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't heard that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.08,1:17:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.17,1:17:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.63,1:18:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes before the new year.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.68,1:18:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to spend it with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.10,1:18:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We will or will not continue\Nthis conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.27,1:18:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Dirk. Ha, ha.\N- Hey, Scotty. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.94,1:18:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fucking New Year's, right?\N- 1980.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.94,1:18:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, man, right. Did you see my new car?\N- You got a new car?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.78,1:18:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah. Wanna see?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.16,1:18:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, cool. It's out front.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.12,1:18:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's out front.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.41,1:18:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirk. I want you to meet my friend Todd.\NTodd Parker, Dirk Diggler.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.67,1:18:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's up? How are you?\N- We finally meet.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.75,1:18:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.96,1:18:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I was telling you about him before.\NYou remember. Todd Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.01,1:18:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- He works at Party Boys Strip Club.\N- Oh, cool. You're a dancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.09,1:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, I got some moves.\N- Dirk? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.60,1:18:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You coming?\NOr you wanna talk to these guys...?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.39,1:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Scotty. I'll be around in a bit.\NWe can talk then?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.14,1:18:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- See you later, Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.60,1:18:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.69,1:19:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, when you get by, uh, the lights,\Nclose your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.82,1:19:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay?\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.99,1:19:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, just follow my voice. All right?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.53,1:19:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here, here, here.\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.50,1:19:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep coming. All right, open them.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.62,1:19:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.63,1:19:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's cool.\N- Yeah. You wanna get inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.46,1:19:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- When did you get this?\N- Uh, yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.21,1:19:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I had it painted yesterday\Nso the paint might still be kind of sticky.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.18,1:19:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is great, man. Really great.\N- You wanna go for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.68,1:19:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. Fuck.\NHell, how much time is left?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.85,1:19:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry, Dirk.\N- What the hell is the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.60,1:19:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why did you do that, Scotty?\N- Uh, you look at me sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- I wanted to know if you like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.69,1:19:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of cour... Uh.\NYeah, I like you, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.82,1:19:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I kiss you? Please?\N- Scotty, I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.03,1:19:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Can I kiss you on the mouth?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.87,1:19:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please let me.\N- Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.28,1:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry. I didn't mean\Nto grab you like that or scare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.70,1:19:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's all right.\N- Do you wanna kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.66,1:19:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Scotty, wha...?\N- No?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.92,1:19:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is the matter with you?\N- Uh, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.00,1:20:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really drunk. Really, I am. I'm just...\NI'm out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.88,1:20:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so wa... I'm really wasted.\NReally, Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.55,1:20:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm really wasted. I'm crazy right now.\N- I understand, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.51,1:20:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm really crazy, you know?\N- Do you wanna go back inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.23,1:20:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.77,1:20:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you like my car, Dirk?\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.35,1:20:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- I mean...\N- Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.19,1:20:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I wanted to, you know...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.23,1:20:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make sure\Nyou thought it was cool...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.61,1:20:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...or else I was gonna take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.28,1:20:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.99,1:20:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- It's great, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.74,1:20:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.53,1:20:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Happy New Year, Scotty.\N- I love you. I really love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.50,1:20:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- I love you too, Scotty.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.46,1:20:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, let's go back inside, okay?\N- All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.59,1:20:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.43,1:20:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.14,1:21:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.78,1:21:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking idiot. Fucking idiot.\NFucking idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.91,1:21:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jackie. Jackie.\NTwo minutes, pops. Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.96,1:21:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.92,1:21:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Two. Two minutes. Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.76,1:21:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Little Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.47,1:21:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Becky, I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.64,1:21:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Bill. Smile, man. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.44,1:21:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.40,1:21:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.82,1:21:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Bill, champagne?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.87,1:21:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Aw, thanks. That's really nice of you.\N- Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.45,1:21:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- To you too.\N- Okay, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.79,1:22:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get some champagne, dude.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.34,1:22:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry, I don't have any matches.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.34,1:22:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got it here, hold on.\N- Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.26,1:22:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kurt, have you seen my wife?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.01,1:22:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Hey, they're doing\Nthat countdown thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.39,1:22:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on in, man.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.52,1:23:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something. Make a toast.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.64,1:23:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Little Bill, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.50,1:24:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.05,1:24:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.51,1:24:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck was that?\N- Where's Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.48,1:24:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.82,1:24:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your character Brock Landers...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.86,1:24:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...and what some people might consider\Nviolent attitudes towards women?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.70,1:24:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence? No. What...?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if there's a certain amount\Nof, you know, violence or action...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.88,1:24:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...in this series of films,\Nyou know, that's the movie.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.55,1:24:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If Brock Landers is slick with a gun...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.55,1:25:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...he does so\Nonly in the vein of good and right.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Brock protects the values\Nof the American ideal...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.56,1:25:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...and fights for causes that instill pride in\Na society where morals are hard to come by.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.15,1:25:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who sent you? Who sent you?\N- Get the fuck off me, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.02,1:25:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie still! Lie still\Nor I'll punch you in the goddamn face!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.03,1:25:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.41,1:25:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find out who sent you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.66,1:25:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Amber, I live in this world.\NI don't like violence any more than you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.58,1:25:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Violence is a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.84,1:25:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you see violence in films, it's...\NYou know...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.59,1:25:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,if movies, films, caused violence...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.72,1:25:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...we'd be able\Nto wipe out violence tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.89,1:25:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom, no more films.\NThat's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.89,1:25:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find something else to do.\NI'll fuck on my own time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.69,1:25:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I got other interests.\NI'm a magician.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.40,1:25:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, and, you know, hopefully, that'll be\Nsomething that I focus on in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.86,1:26:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you can't fuck forever.\NI realize that. Anyway, violence...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.07,1:26:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...is something that plagues us\Nas a society.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.12,1:26:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the fine line is\NI'm playing a character.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.75,1:26:10.100,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I mean, I'm Dirk Diggler.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.00,1:26:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Brock Landers\Nis a character that I'm playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.09,1:26:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask you once more,\Nand I'm gonna ask you nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.84,1:26:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck is Ringo, you bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.22,1:26:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.89,1:26:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.10,1:26:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Uh, why do I love him?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.35,1:26:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's, uh... He's very special.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.85,1:26:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, he can fuck hard\Nor he can fuck, like, really gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.65,1:26:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.56,1:26:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I think that's part of my reason\Nfor doing this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.86,1:26:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten thousands\Nupon thousands of letters...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.70,1:26:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...you know, from people telling me:
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.57,1:26:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"God, you've taught me this and\Nyou've made our love life so much better."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.79,1:26:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And this isn't "Go out and have sex\Nwith 10 million people."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.79,1:26:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And, you know, "How to get a girl off."\NIt's about how to get your wife off.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.63,1:26:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If only people\Ncould have been doing this before...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.13,1:27:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...we could have saved\Na million relationships.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.67,1:27:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've saved thousands.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.43,1:27:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Blocking, an idea or a movement.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.43,1:27:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack will put the final touches together\Nfor what the camera needs for editing...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.14,1:27:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...but, you know, he allows me\Nto block my own sex scenes...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.35,1:27:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, you know, gives me the freedom to\Ndevelop the character and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.40,1:27:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,God, ha, ha, I don't know any other,\Nyou know, director...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.07,1:27:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...who would let an actor,\Nyou know, do that, heh. You know?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.86,1:27:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha. I don't allow him\Nto block his own sex scenes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.08,1:27:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It is. It's jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.50,1:27:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deceitfulness. It's vindictiveness.\NIt's all of that stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.21,1:27:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I mean, God, what can you expect\Nwhen you're on top, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.46,1:27:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Napoleon.\NWhen he was the king...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.34,1:27:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...you know, people were constantly\Ntrying to conquer him...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.26,1:27:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...you know, in the Roman Empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.35,1:27:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's history repeating itself\Nall over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.02,1:27:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To all the critics out there,\NI know they're gonna be reviewing this...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.52,1:27:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I know\Nthey're gonna try to knock me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.69,1:28:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want them to know... Is it okay\Nif I say this into the camera, Amber?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.40,1:28:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.53,1:28:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I only am who I am\Nbecause I was born that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.32,1:28:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a gift, and I am trying\Nto not be selfish about it, but to use it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.20,1:28:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? And if you wanna knock me for that,\Nit's your own problem, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.54,1:28:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealousy will get you nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.17,1:28:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna keep rocking on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.88,1:28:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,For Dirk Diggler...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.55,1:28:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...the future is something\Nto look forward to, not to fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.55,1:28:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a creative man of many interests:
