Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.85,1:40:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think the bass\Nis taking away from the vocal?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.35,1:40:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really. Maybe.\NIt sounds balanced to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.60,1:40:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely taking away from my vocal.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.77,1:40:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take the bass down\Nand bring up the vocals.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.61,1:40:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do it, Nick. You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.94,1:40:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna take it from the top?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.61,1:40:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, let's try it.\N- Okay.
