Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.88,1:41:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's definitely cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.13,1:41:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's lay it down. Nick?\N- You wanna lay it down?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.97,1:41:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Were we rolling on that rehearsal?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.72,1:41:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna fuck me in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.68,1:41:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that what you want?\N- It would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.02,1:41:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck her in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.86,1:41:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock and load, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.12,1:42:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna take a pottery class\Nat Everywoman's Village.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.74,1:42:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I wanna do that.\N- Okay, we'll do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.20,1:42:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays at 3.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.33,1:42:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was thinking something.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.33,1:42:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was gonna see about taking the GED.\NDo you know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.09,1:42:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mm-hm, for high school, to graduate.\N- It's because I never got my diploma.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:18.76,1:42:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad, you know, that, uh...\NI think you were right about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.18,1:42:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should do it, Rollergirl,\Nbecause you know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.31,1:42:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanted to, you could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.94,1:42:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Swope.\N- Yes. That's me. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.23,1:42:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- You have your loan application?\N- Yes, I do. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.69,1:42:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Good. You wanna follow me?\N- Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.24,1:42:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kurt, are we gonna\Nhave any more coverage on this, or...?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.57,1:42:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. We just keep shooting.\NThis is video.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.99,1:42:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We shoot and shoot,\Nand then we deal with it later.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.66,1:42:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, now, Summer,\NI want you to take Skye's thong off.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.58,1:42:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That thong thing. Yeah, actually take\Nit off. That's good. And finger it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.13,1:42:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good. Lick the thong. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.09,1:43:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nthat's really good technically, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.67,1:43:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But it lacks passion.\NI wanna see some passion here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.68,1:43:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.72,1:43:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.18,1:43:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Lick my balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.23,1:43:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.35,1:43:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's your daddy, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.73,1:43:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You live. You live. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.70,1:43:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.82,1:43:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.62,1:43:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.79,1:43:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck took you so long, man?\N- Todd.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.47,1:43:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.68,1:43:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really what Buck's Super Stereo World\Nis all about. It's about the customer.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.72,1:43:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,People wanna know\Nwhat they're getting into technically.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.48,1:43:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the specific\Ntechnical hi-fi background...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.98,1:43:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...to answer any question\Nsomebody's gonna have.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.35,1:43:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been in sound equipment\Nlong enough to know...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.86,1:44:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...what a guy wants\Nwhen he walks through that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.48,1:44:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of personal touch\NBuck's Super Stereo World's gonna have.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.66,1:44:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss my two sons, you know.\NI miss my little Andrew and... And my Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.100,1:44:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\NI always felt like Dirk was my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.79,1:44:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My new baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.50,1:44:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't you miss Dirk?\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.97,1:44:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so fucking talented, the bastard.\NYou know, I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.64,1:44:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I love him, Rollergirl. I mean, I\Nreally love the stupid jerk, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.94,1:44:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.19,1:44:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to be my mom, Amber.\NAre you my mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.52,1:44:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just...\NI'll ask you if you're my mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.82,1:44:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And you say yes, okay?\NAre you my mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.32,1:44:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.74,1:44:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ha.\N- Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.66,1:44:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't try...\N- Hold on. Come on, come on, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.54,1:44:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need is the tapes, Burt.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.92,1:45:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No. You don't get them until you pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.46,1:45:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In our situation,\Nthat doesn't make any fucking sense!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.13,1:45:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. We can't pay\Nthe price of the demo tapes...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.68,1:45:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...unless we take the demo tapes\Nto the record company and get paid!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.31,1:45:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.72,1:45:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not an MP.\NThat's a YP. "Your problem."
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.73,1:45:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come up with the money\Nand I'll give you the tapes. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.73,1:45:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, now you're talking above my head.\NI don't know this industry jargon.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.36,1:45:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,YP, MP. Whatever, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.90,1:45:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is that\NI cannot get a record contract...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.65,1:45:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot get a record contract\Nunless I take these tapes...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.03,1:45:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And granted,\Nthe tapes themselves are your...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.20,1:45:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your busi... Are your...\NYou own them, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.25,1:45:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But the magic that is on the tapes,\Nthat fucking heart and soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.08,1:45:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...that we put into those tapes,\Nthat is ours, and you don't own that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.55,1:45:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I need to take that magic\Nand get it to the record company.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.09,1:45:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,They're waiting. We were supposed\Nto be there a half-hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.14,1:45:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We look like assholes right now, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.16,1:46:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, this could be the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.08,1:46:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to help us\Nscore a little extra cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.83,1:46:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy's name is Rahad Jackson.\NHe's got more money than God.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.67,1:46:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got twice as much coke, crank,\Nand smack. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.76,1:46:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's gonna buy just about anything\Nanybody wants to sell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.39,1:46:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just likes people hanging around\Nat his house partying, the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.31,1:46:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.85,1:46:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to come to Party Boys a lot.\NMutrix introduced me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.69,1:46:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How will we do it exactly?\NHow would it all go down?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.31,1:46:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna go down like this.\NI'm gonna call him on the phone...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.40,1:46:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'm gonna tell him\NI got a half a key of quality stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.90,1:46:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have his phone number?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.03,1:46:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.61,1:46:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna call him on the phone.\NI'm gonna give him a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.99,1:46:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:46.20,1:46:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's half a key, man.\NIt's, like, 5000 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.70,1:46:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- You split that up three ways...\N- It's enough to get the Vette fixed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.12,1:46:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, man.\NSo we're gonna do the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.34,1:46:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drop\Nhalf a key of baking soda into a bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.05,1:47:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna walk over there.\NWe're gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.55,1:47:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boom. Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.01,1:47:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- This could be a nifty bit of hustle-bustle.\N- Wait. Do you have his address?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.27,1:47:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking, Reed, yeah.\NI got his fucking address.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.60,1:47:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yeah, okay, question. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.44,1:47:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on. What if he tests the stuff out?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.15,1:47:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- He won't.\N- Well, how do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.90,1:47:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know he won't. I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.66,1:47:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.08,1:47:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- Scotty.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.41,1:47:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "What?"
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.75,1:47:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor. Just mind your business,\Nplease. What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.79,1:47:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.46,1:47:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, heh...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.42,1:47:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dump it in there good. Dump it in clean.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.47,1:47:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey,\Nyou can't lay this all on me, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.76,1:47:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go in there... This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.10,1:47:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.60,1:47:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys ready for this?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.56,1:47:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am.\N- Dirk?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.44,1:47:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me? Yeah, yeah. I was born ready, man.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.15,1:48:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- What the fuck is that?\N- It's a big gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.94,1:48:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- No shit, but why?\N- Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.40,1:48:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.95,1:48:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking great.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.16,1:48:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- You never said anything about a gun.\N- Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.20,1:48:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm nervous. Do you have a gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.79,1:48:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I don't have a gun. He never said...\N- Shh. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.12,1:48:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's just get in and out, all right? In, out.\N- Not too fast. It makes it look suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.80,1:48:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.55,1:48:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.63,1:48:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Just let me do all the talking, all right?\N- Just be cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.60,1:48:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing? Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.74,1:48:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.78,1:48:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, man.\N- Hello, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.91,1:48:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.51,1:49:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rahad.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.84,1:49:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.68,1:49:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey.\N- Which one is Todd?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.34,1:49:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's me. Ha, ha.\NWe met before, down at Party Boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.35,1:49:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. Yeah, yeah, yeah.\NCome on in. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.02,1:49:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, these are my friends here.\NDirk and Reed.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.19,1:49:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Good to see you.\NTake a seat. You want something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.23,1:49:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Want a pill? Coke? Little dope?\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.07,1:49:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- Uh, you sure you don't want something?\N- No, thank you. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.57,1:49:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So got something? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.53,1:49:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We got something here?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.70,1:49:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is.\NThat's about half a key right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.37,1:49:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right.\N- That is some quality shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.79,1:49:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- If you wanna test that out...\N- Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.09,1:49:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...I mean, go ahead. If you want.\N- No, no, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.01,1:49:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's that build-up. I love this part.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.77,1:49:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking love that song.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.73,1:50:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So anyway, uh, what's the price?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.90,1:50:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ha-ha-ha, we, ha-ha-ha...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.66,1:50:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe, I don't know, 5 grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.67,1:50:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Five grand.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.59,1:50:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. No problem. That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.18,1:50:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Five grand?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.81,1:50:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Five grand.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.73,1:50:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.79,1:51:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys wanna play baseball?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.100,1:51:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, thank you.\N- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.79,1:51:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The black guy has a gun in his jacket.\NTodd?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.14,1:51:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get up and get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.39,1:51:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, count the fucking money in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.62,1:51:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you wanna see something\Nreally fascinating?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.92,1:51:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Check it out.\N- Oh, wow. That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.84,1:51:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- That thing's not loaded, is it?\N- Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.88,1:51:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that silver?\N- Look... See, we...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.55,1:51:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's see what happens now, huh?\N- Don't point...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.01,1:52:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Could you not point the gun, please, sir?\N- Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.48,1:52:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Todd.\N- You wanna watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.02,1:52:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why? You think I can't do it?\N- No, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.48,1:52:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Huh? Ha-ha-ha. You think I can't do it?\N- Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.19,1:52:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- You wanna see me do it? You dare me?\N- No, we don't dare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.36,1:52:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking dare me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.54,1:52:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.71,1:52:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fucking faces, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.42,1:52:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.55,1:52:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I love this thing. I make these\Nlittle mix tapes together, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.10,1:52:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I put all my favorite songs together. Which\None is this? Number, uh, 11. I love it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.52,1:52:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, when you buy a tape\Nor something or an album...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.73,1:52:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...you put it on, and the songs,\Nthe bands put them in some fucking order...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.40,1:52:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...like they want you to listen to it in\Nthat order. I hate that. Fucking hate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.44,1:52:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like to be told what to listen to,\Nwhen to listen to it, or anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.58,1:53:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.62,1:53:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Cosmo. He's Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.50,1:53:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he likes\Nlighting off firecrackers. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.29,1:53:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ricky Springfield. He's a buddy of mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.81,1:54:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, we're leaving, man. Todd.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.27,1:54:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.44,1:54:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.86,1:54:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir. We gotta split, man. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.95,1:55:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on. You just got here.\NLet's hang out, let's party.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.86,1:55:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We got somewhere else to go.\NWe scheduled dinner with friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.91,1:55:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not leaving yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.54,1:55:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here now,\Nand we want something else from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.09,1:55:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.01,1:55:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:21.51,1:55:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We want something else from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.68,1:55:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.89,1:55:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, what the hell are you doing, man?\NLet's just go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.73,1:55:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In the master bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.90,1:55:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...under the bed in a floor safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.86,1:55:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.90,1:55:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is the matter with you? Let's go.\N- Todd.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.49,1:55:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on, man.\N- Shut up, Dirk.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.07,1:55:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I got a plan.\NI got a very good plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.37,1:55:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me, kitty?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.24,1:55:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not, see?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.04,1:55:52.100,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding.\NI want what's in the safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.17,1:55:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We want what is in the goddamn safe,\Nin the goddamn master bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.54,1:55:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...in the fucking floor, in a goddamn\Nfucking floor safe, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.09,1:56:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, don't be crazy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.72,1:56:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we don't know anything about this.\NThis is not at all what we wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.30,1:56:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the fuck up, Dirk.\NDo not reach for your gun, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.68,1:56:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't reach for your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.78,1:56:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He went in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.45,1:56:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, what the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.66,1:56:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- He went in the bedroom.\N- Todd, when the fuck did you go crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.95,1:56:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got coke, and he's got cash\Nin that safe in that bedroom...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.29,1:56:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...and if we leave here without it,\Nwe're fucking idiots, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.29,1:56:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came here\Nto motherfucking do something.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.46,1:56:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And we can fucking do it, all right?\NYou with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.88,1:56:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Todd, listen to me. Let's just split, man.\NLet's just split now. This is not the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.47,1:56:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not supposed to be the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.47,1:56:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I goddamn came here\Nto motherfucking do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.89,1:56:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's what I'm gonna fucking do\Nright the fuck now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.77,1:56:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck no! Todd, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.23,1:57:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't be fucking stupid!\N- Todd! Todd!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.49,1:57:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on!\N- Fuck! Go, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.57,1:57:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, you puppies.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.49,1:57:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming down for puppies!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.80,1:57:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on, come on. Puppies!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.09,1:57:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.47,1:57:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.85,1:57:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:36.77,1:57:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.33,1:57:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Fucking son of a bitch. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.71,1:57:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Oh, fuck. Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:00.13,1:58:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck. Fucking stupid motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.46,1:58:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God. Oh, God. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.01,1:58:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:13.56,1:58:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fuck. Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.56,1:59:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.24,1:59:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack, could you please help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.59,1:59:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.39,1:59:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.77,1:59:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I just... l wanted to come\Nand say sorry, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.02,1:59:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.31,1:59:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I just wanna know\Nif you can help me, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.15,1:59:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I, um... l need help.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.32,1:59:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.66,1:59:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...I'm sorry, you know?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.46,2:00:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I need help, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.56,2:00:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so fucking sorry, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.60,2:00:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry too, kid.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.36,2:00:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.90,2:00:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- We all need to start again.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.95,2:00:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.03,2:00:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.07,2:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.54,2:00:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:45.83,2:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.92,2:00:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. You're all right, baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.80,2:00:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- One more. Let's go. Please. Eleven.\N- Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.59,2:00:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.06,2:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I hear someone say deal?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.39,2:01:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This weekend and this weekend only...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.73,2:01:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...Buck's Super Cool Stereo Store is making\Nsuper-cool deals on all name brands.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.23,2:01:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We're open. We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:10.82,2:01:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All you need to do is walk over,\Nget down, and come inside us.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.91,2:01:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Word.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:18.91,2:01:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut. Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:21.83,2:01:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Buck, honey, that was great.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.18,2:01:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, shut up, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.89,2:01:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.69,2:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:54.53,2:02:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cinco, cuatro, tres, dos, uno.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.46,2:02:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait. What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.88,2:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a Q. That's supposed to be a G.\NOh, man. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:44.24,2:02:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.75,2:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty, naughty, Candy.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.26,2:02:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Push.\N- Okay, ready to push?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.88,2:03:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's push. Let's push. Let's push.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.89,2:03:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, baby. Come on, baby.\NGo, go, go. Push, push, push.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.56,2:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.35,2:03:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- God almighty, fucking Christ.\N- We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.94,2:03:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, don't cuss, sweetie.\N- One big push for me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.86,2:03:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Big push for the doctor. Big push.\NThis is it. Big push. Push, push, push.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.07,2:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- I got it, I got it, yeah.\N- He got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.36,2:03:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a boy. It's a boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.87,2:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No hurry, guys.\NJust sometime this year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.13,2:03:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Jack, should we put it in the garage?\N- Put it where I told you to put it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.76,2:03:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:41.18,2:03:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Maurice.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.72,2:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- You've got to turn a fan on.\N- It smells good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.26,2:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No. It smells like shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.89,2:03:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. This is Puerto Rican cooking.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:51.23,2:03:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody's complaining\Nin the whole neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.73,2:03:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what they're complaining about.\NTaste this.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.90,2:03:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I can't taste it, not now.\NI'll taste it later.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:01.15,2:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rollergirl, yoo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.36,2:04:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, honey. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:04.99,2:04:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the dirt on one side of your room\Nand move it to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:08.37,2:04:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Then one side of the room will look clean...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.91,2:04:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...that used to look dirty.\NThat'll be good, huh?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.75,2:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Johnny Weissmuller.\NThat's my swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.67,2:04:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- Say, "Hello, Uncle Jack."\N- Five gold medals, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.84,2:04:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Say, "Hello, Uncle Jack."\N- Oh, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.01,2:04:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- You like Uncle Jack's pool?\N- Who is the Olympic-fever baby?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.06,2:04:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who's the Olympic-fever baby?\N- Say, "Hi, Jack."
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.48,2:04:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Say, "Hi. Hi."\N- "Hi, Jack."
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.02,2:04:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Watch me kick."\N- He's not gonna piss in the pool, is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.85,2:04:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't think so.\N- Do you like Uncle Reed? Yes, you do.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.90,2:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- He is a good boy.\N- Yo, Buck.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:41.73,2:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta talk to you about\Nthe stereo modification for this system.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.95,2:04:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- No technical shit.\N- No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.61,2:04:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't get the right modification\Nit's not gonna be loud.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:49.66,2:04:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Loud isn't what I want.\NI don't want loud.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.79,2:04:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want...\N- Mellow.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.29,2:04:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mellow. That's what I want.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.75,2:04:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Buck, I want mellow.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.96,2:05:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Mellow. Mellow.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.80,2:05:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.46,2:05:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, great, honey. Great.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.14,2:05:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we ready?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.31,2:05:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We have got all the time we want.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:21.86,2:05:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.36,2:05:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm looking at you.\N- You're staring.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.61,2:05:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm staring at?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.66,2:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staring at the foxiest bitch\Nin the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.15,2:06:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been around this block twice now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.78,2:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.86,2:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A clue.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.99,2:06:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for clues,\Nand something led me back here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.54,2:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep. So here I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.75,2:06:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could have been me, the one that was\Nat Ringo's place when the shit went down.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.54,2:06:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know how it is. I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:26.72,2:06:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all done bad things.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.22,2:06:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've all had those guilty feelings\Nin our heart.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.72,2:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna take your brain out of your head\Nand wash it and scrub it and make it clean.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.23,2:06:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:41.06,2:06:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna help you settle this.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.56,2:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,First we're gonna check for holes,\Nsee what we can find.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.78,2:06:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we're gonna get nice and wet\Nand you're gonna spread your legs.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.53,2:06:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's good. So you know me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.33,2:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You know my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.66,2:07:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen inches is a tough load.\NI don't treat you gently.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.42,2:07:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I'm Brock Landers.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.21,2:07:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm gonna be nice.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.01,2:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.35,2:07:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck is Ringo?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:46.17,2:07:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a star.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.46,2:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a star. I'm a star. I'm a star.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:51.47,2:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a big, bright, shining star.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:10.78,2:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:05.69,2:15:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.53,2:15:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:21.71,2:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want...
Dialogue: 0,2:15:25.09,2:15:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.73,2:15:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:48.53,2:15:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. Raphael.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.61,2:15:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.78,2:15:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Ringo?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.62,2:16:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where it goes.